-+### Consecutive line value labels
-+
-+For `LineChart`, set `config.hideConsecutiveDuplicateValues: true` together
-+with an x-indexed `config.valueFormatter` string array. Adjacent identical,
-+non-empty labels keep only their first label. Empty labels break a run, so a
-+later run gets its own label. This also works with individual marker datasets
-+sharing the same formatter array. Points, circles, selection, axis labels and
-+other datasets are unchanged. Disabled by default.
-+
-+The JS adapter prepares immutable chart data once per data reference and shares
-+processed formatter arrays. No per-frame work or native rebuild is required.
